{"id":"vod_sn_35523","vodId":"35523","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"少年同盟第一季","name_cn":"少年同盟第一季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c3a95368e693aec280ac186c9c099e44.jpg"},"summary":"故事围绕着五位少年的校园生活展开，双胞胎兄弟浅羽悠太和佑希，和他们的青梅竹马——冢原要和松冈春，以及转校生橘千鹤。一个个清新淡雅的画面，描绘了五位少年一段段幽默温馨的青春故事。　　在漫天樱花飞舞中，穗稀高中的学生迎来了开学典礼。四名少年曾经在春天相遇，之后便共同度过了许多个春天，今年的他们成为了穗稀高中的二年级生。新学年的开始，冢原要强迫佑希参加学校的社团，运动神经很发达的佑希却情愿躲在家里看漫画……不久后，个性活泼外向的混血儿橘千鹤转到他们班上，原来他曾经是佑希的童年玩伴。自此，五人开始了属于他们的简简单单但又真真实实的青春生活。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:35:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vZ6BWjMEcH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7S5WW1qQVd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qw37yx62kB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tAcCkyfFYq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M18ZYsXsjH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uG3JJvzQYn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KLxbvS1Tq41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pJ36YFfxua1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CcLpihmT7M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HeLamGdchX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ykpNNXsbKa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LQd7SiggH81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zqD5w6aUv51/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:34.171Z"}